      "content": "The feeling of being stuck is a heavy, suffocating thing, and it makes the idea of stopping seem like the only relief. If the noise is unbearable, there is a way to quiet it, and it doesn't have to be this painful way. Reaching out to someone who can listen without judgment is the first step to breaking that loop. Please call or text a crisis line; they can help you find a different way through this darkness.",
